---
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <span class="chip">🍅 5U5 — OPET U PET</span>
      <h1>Okus doma,<br />kvaliteta koju osjetiš.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Obiteljsko gospodarstvo iz Vrbovca. Svježe sezonsko povrće, pažljivo uzgojeno
         i dostavljeno direktno s polja na vaš stol.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a href="#ponuda" class="btn btn-primary">Pogledaj ponudu</a>
        <a href="tel:+385992339515" class="btn btn-ghost">099 233 9515</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero__facts">
        <li><strong>Svježe s polja</strong><span>ubrano po narudžbi</span></li>
        <li><strong>Domaće &amp; sezonsko</strong><span>uzgojeno u Vrbovcu</span></li>
        <li><strong>Preuzimanje i dostava</strong><span>Jednostavno i brzo</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- Zamijeniti pravom fotografijom u punoj rezoluciji (Astro <Image />). -->
      <div class="hero__photo">
        <span class="hero__photo-label">Fotografija polja / povrća</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__badge">
        <strong>100%</strong>
        <span>domaći uzgoj</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 80% -10%, var(--c-cream-2), transparent 60%),
      var(--c-cream);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero__copy h1 { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .hero__cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem; }

  .hero__facts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .hero__facts li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-brand);
  }
  .hero__facts strong { font-weight: 800; }
  .hero__facts span { color: var(--c-ink-soft); font-size: 0.92rem; }

  .hero__media { position: relative; }
  .hero__photo {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3.4;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-brand) 0%, var(--c-brand-dark) 100%);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero__photo::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), transparent 45%);
  }
  .hero__photo-label {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .hero__badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -18px;
    left: -14px;
    background: var(--c-white);
    color: var(--c-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.1;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);
  }
  .hero__badge strong { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--c-brand); }
  .hero__badge span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--c-ink-soft); font-weight: 700; }

  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .hero__inner { grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; }
    .hero__facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
</style>
